This example shows the basic setup of global C++ constructors and
destructors in action.

uClinux toolchains are an entire mess. This example is known to run well on
arm-elf-tools-20040427.sh from Samsung.

http://opensrc.sec.samsung.com/Getting_Familiar_with_uClinuxARM2_6.html

Please, note that it uses HW-FP, therefore you need the FP emulator.

